{
    "title": "WeWard - The Walking App",
    "description": "WeWard is thrilled to take you on a journey to celebrate sports and the spirit around the Games in Paris this summer. In this period, join us in our Global Walk Cup 2024 and compete like your favorite athletes by walking for your country\r\n\r\nBesides helping your country win the Walk Cup, you'll also earn many rewards! Last but not least, the winning country will have the opportunity to select a charity, which WeWard will support with a $15,000 contribution!\r\n\r\nJoin the WeWard community for a walking adventure like no other! \r\n\r\nGet ready to feel more motivated than ever as you earn rewards for every step you take. Crush challenges and level up as you outpace your friends on the leaderboard! Turn your 'Wards' into good vibes by donating to your favorite charity*, entering high-value sweepstakes, or earn money from walking by scoring direct bank transfers or gift cards. Ready to step up your walking game? Let's get moving!\r\n\r\n*Don't see your NPO of choice within our app? Reach out and we'll see what we can do to change that. We've funded over $1 million in charitable donations to date, and we don't plan on slowing down.\r\n\r\nSo, why should you download WeWard?\r\n\r\nOur Mission\r\n\r\nWalking is a means of achieving balance, and it is our mission to get more people walking the world over! For this reason, we\u2019ve made the app suitable for people of all fitness levels and abilities. People have been proven to walk 24% more with WeWard, aligning with our goal to end sedentary lifestyles. By downloading WeWard, you'll be joining over 20 million users who are making walking a more fun and rewarding part of their lives!\r\n\r\nWalk and Earn\r\n\r\nFrom financial rewards to connecting with your community to supporting a cause, WeWard can reward you with whatever you want to get out of walking. Convert your steps into bank transfers, charity donations, gift cards, or high-value sweepstakes entries. Get rewarded for every step you take!\r\n\r\nGamification + Motivation\r\n\r\nWardy, our mascot, will guide you through a series of challenges and continuously push you to walk more. Newer app features such as Uplevel Adventure will have you exploring the world in brand new ways, helping you to truly step up your walking game. We'll highlight some of your key walking feats as you aim to max out your personalized pedometer each day!\r\n\r\nWalk with (or against) Friends\r\n\r\nTeam up or try to outpace your friends and family on our social leaderboards. Don\u2019t worry, they won\u2019t judge you for your lazy Sundays.\r\n\r\nExclusive Partner Offers\r\n\r\nWe partner with some of your favorite brands (booking.com, Forever 21, and Netflix to name a few), and hope to introduce you to some new ones, too! Get access to special offers and cashback options, exclusively in the WeWard app.\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Download the WeWard app and join over 20 million users who are making walking a more fun and rewarding part of their lives! If you have any questions or feedback about the app, we\u2019re happy to help. Please email contact@wewardapp.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "WeWard is thrilled to take you on a journey to celebrate sports and the spirit around the Games in Paris this summer. In this period, join us in our Global Walk Cup 2024 and compete like your favorite athletes by walking for your country<br><br>Besides helping your country win the Walk Cup, you&#39;ll also earn many rewards! Last but not least, the winning country will have the opportunity to select a charity, which WeWard will support with a $15,000 contribution!<br><br>Join the WeWard community for a walking adventure like no other! <br><br>Get ready to feel more motivated than ever as you earn rewards for every step you take. Crush challenges and level up as you outpace your friends on the leaderboard! Turn your &#39;Wards&#39; into good vibes by donating to your favorite charity*, entering high-value sweepstakes, or earn money from walking by scoring direct bank transfers or gift cards. Ready to step up your walking game? Let&#39;s get moving!<br><br>*Don&#39;t see your NPO of choice within our app? Reach out and we&#39;ll see what we can do to change that. We&#39;ve funded over $1 million in charitable donations to date, and we don&#39;t plan on slowing down.<br><br>So, why should you download WeWard?<br><br>Our Mission<br><br>Walking is a means of achieving balance, and it is our mission to get more people walking the world over! For this reason, we\u2019ve made the app suitable for people of all fitness levels and abilities. People have been proven to walk 24% more with WeWard, aligning with our goal to end sedentary lifestyles. By downloading WeWard, you&#39;ll be joining over 20 million users who are making walking a more fun and rewarding part of their lives!<br><br>Walk and Earn<br><br>From financial rewards to connecting with your community to supporting a cause, WeWard can reward you with whatever you want to get out of walking. Convert your steps into bank transfers, charity donations, gift cards, or high-value sweepstakes entries. Get rewarded for every step you take!<br><br>Gamification + Motivation<br><br>Wardy, our mascot, will guide you through a series of challenges and continuously push you to walk more. Newer app features such as Uplevel Adventure will have you exploring the world in brand new ways, helping you to truly step up your walking game. We&#39;ll highlight some of your key walking feats as you aim to max out your personalized pedometer each day!<br><br>Walk with (or against) Friends<br><br>Team up or try to outpace your friends and family on our social leaderboards. Don\u2019t worry, they won\u2019t judge you for your lazy Sundays.<br><br>Exclusive Partner Offers<br><br>We partner with some of your favorite brands (booking.com, Forever 21, and Netflix to name a few), and hope to introduce you to some new ones, too! Get access to special offers and cashback options, exclusively in the WeWard app.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Download the WeWard app and join over 20 million users who are making walking a more fun and rewarding part of their lives! If you have any questions or feedback about the app, we\u2019re happy to help. Please email contact@wewardapp.com.",
